msgid "局部溶剂壳（Local Solvation）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:5
#: eadaa8bb22ec4ea89bc7549af375d98d
msgid "**分类：** 分子与溶剂"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:7
#: fbe8bbbee37c4a0eb4248b0c2c151f15
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:9
#: 9c920dbc394f414ba122082f602f12b4
msgid ""
"`Local Solvation` 在选中原子周围插入一批溶剂分子，用来补充离子水合壳、局部极"
"性环境、溶质附近初始溶剂排布等候选构型。它只生成几何初态，不做力场或 DFT 优"
"化，也不保证得到平衡溶剂化数或平衡取向。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:11
#: 5a24f860d30d4500926881361cc632f0
msgid ""
"这张卡保留输入结构，并追加溶剂原子；碰撞检查只负责排除明显短接触。`Auto` 会根"
"据溶剂是否为一水分子以及中心元素是否包含内置离子来解析实际放置模式。卡片首帧"
"预览会显示中心数、溶剂分子式、解析后的模式和真正采用的碰撞规则。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:13
#: 74f13d87ebee4a2eb6bd548c59c4a004
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:15
#: 78dd9b9bfeaf41d8b0e9c883c2dafe08
msgid ""
"程序先按中心选择规则得到中心原子集合 $\\mathcal C$，再在球壳 $r_{\\min}\\le "
"r\\le r_{\\max}$ 中抽样溶剂质心。若按体积均匀采样，半径可写为"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:18
#: 61c8c95f6b5d4dc581fb962d7dbfc940
msgid ""
"\n"
"r=\\left[r_{\\min}^3+u\\left(r_{\\max}^3-r_{\\min}^3\\right)\\right]^{1/3},\n"
"\\qquad u\\sim U(0,1).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:23
#: 05101e2255974f3d8d5a6aaf883b1dd1
msgid ""
"每个候选分子还会随机取向，并对宿主、已放置溶剂及周期镜像执行碰撞检查。`自动/"
"水/疏松/ 致密`模式选择不同的预设碰撞尺度和采样策略；用户显式填写碰撞尺度时覆"
"盖预设。柔性构象 选项会先生成有限构象池再参与放置，不是在放置过程中做分子动力"
"学。达到尝试上限仍无合法 位置时会失败，不会把重叠结构当作成功结果。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:28
#: bca18099452b414f943fa7ad04acaa3f
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:30
#: 6bfeee5a9a9f4b26a54df7b835b98ae7
msgid "场景：模型没有见过离子第一水合壳"
msgstr "Scenario: The first hydration shell of an ion is missing"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:32
#: dfee9fb61abe409c8d51652620ea1f38
msgid ""
"你训练了含 Ca 的体系，但训练集里 Ca 周围几乎都是干结构。模型在含水环境里预测 "
"Ca-O 局部相互作用时异常。先用 `Local Solvation` 选中 Ca 原子，插入 4-8 个水分"
"子，生成候选水合壳，再经过几何检查和 DFT 松弛。"
msgstr ""
"A Ca-containing training set is almost entirely dry and gives abnormal Ca-O "
"interactions in water. Select Ca centers and insert 4-8 water molecules to "
"propose hydration shells, then apply geometry checks and DFT relaxation "
"before using them as labels."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:34
#: b60a3eb0b2794ee6b48592c7d5613488
msgid ""
"参数设置：中心选择“按元素”并填 `Ca`，放置模式选“自动识别溶剂 / 离子”，每个输"
"出放 6 个水分子，统一最小距离可先设为 `0.8 Å`，打开固定种子。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:36
#: 36f2c930d6d64b658d71e5374f8064b6
msgid ""
"在 `ion-water` 模式下，Ca 第一配位壳的 O 原子距离来自内置 `2.30–2.60 Å` 区"
"间；界面上的“备用质心壳层”只在该离子的内置配位数填满之后使用。不要把备用壳层"
"误认为第一壳 Ca–O 距离。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:38
#: d0d1bf480df44d5c9ac76d2abbd26165
msgid ""
"检查输出时重点看 Ca-O 距离、短 H-H/O-H 非键接触、以及 DFT 松弛后是否仍保持合"
"理水合结构。"
msgstr ""
"Inspect Ca-O distances, short nonbonded H-H/O-H contacts, and whether the "
"shell remains physically meaningful after DFT relaxation."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:40
#: 99d2a661ca534346bad3fdce7de16d2a
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:42
#: 33f8040e59484d2b99710ddc24f400bd
msgid "溶剂输入"
msgstr "Solvent input"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:44
#: f30c8aa482c04c18acfca355d733837b
msgid "溶剂 XYZ（solvent_xyz）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:46
#: 05d925c9ebb4408bb93b260813db1616
msgid ""
"`str`，默认是一个三原子水分子 XYZ。这里保存的是溶剂分子文本，而不是文件路径，"
"因此 card JSON 可以脱离原始文件复现。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default a three-atom water XYZ block. The parameter stores molecule "
"text rather than a path, allowing card JSON to reproduce the input without "
"the original file."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:48
#: 09049ffe37484f8092df17e67254d888
msgid "每个输入的独立输出数（structures）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:50
#: b4799e803bf440b4b6c7b4513c914008
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个输入结构生成多少个独立溶剂化版本。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`. Independent solvated variants per input."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:52
#: 81ff8c1ff7124978b570b9c08ad5398f
msgid "每个输出的溶剂分子数（solvent_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:54
#: 376ce6f3888d4597afb77ee8ba7ed277
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 6。每个输出结构插入多少个溶剂分子。离子第一壳通常从 4–8 开始；大"
"分子局部溶剂环境再按中心原子数量扩大。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:56
#: 78da31a35cf3496ba287a3c805854cd2
msgid "放置配置（sampling_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:58
#: c27a8ba2032045b3b0596509b2427ef6
msgid "`str`，默认 `auto`。可选项："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:60
#: b4a386a5334e42e3afd63b4807cf3e0c
msgid ""
"`auto`：水 + 内置离子中心时解析为 `ion-water`；只有水时解析为 `water`；其他溶"
"剂解析为 `general`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:61
#: f3d93d6d18d14613a0de994fc5c49ef7
msgid "`general`：在备用质心壳层内随机放置和取向。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:62
#: 6357c07208d34a2ba676fde503deee36
msgid "`water`：在备用质心壳层内放置水，并让 O→H 中点的方向大致背离局部中心。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:63
#: 69656e1b90044523a4caef2b3fc09898
msgid ""
"`ion-water`：内置离子的前若干个水使用元素专属 ion–O 区间并让 H 侧背离离子；达"
"到内置配位数后回到备用质心壳层。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:64
#: a3948af82b5647e4902689e98aa2e948
msgid ""
"`loose` / `dense`：主要改变默认碰撞半径缩放；它们不会自动改写界面中的备用壳层"
"数值。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:66
#: b2eb4d10ccf24810b384ab17c5f51f5f
msgid "中心原子选择"
msgstr "Center selection"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:68
#: 63475ac606ef479ab8ec5071e46bd60b
msgid "溶剂化中心（center_mode）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:70
#: 21ec3e4d80a340678e23cfc23a71fd68
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `all`。可选 `all`、`elements`、`indices`、`Z 轴范围`"
"（`z_range`）。这决定哪些原子作为局部溶剂化中心。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:72
#: e40efad08ee84eaa96e8ad1f8ef8527c
msgid "中心元素（center_elements）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:74
#: 8e1334c9eda54bf7888b16bdfe95eb47
msgid "`str`，默认空。`center_mode=\"elements\"` 时生效，例如 `Ca,Na,O`。"
msgstr "`str`, empty by default; elements mode only. Example: `Ca,Na,O`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:76
#: 1a8036bdf4b746aab1749fe7517704bd
msgid "中心索引（center_indices）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:78
#: 14ef5e24ea1349b698cb87fc615fe17e
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。`center_mode=\"indices\"` 时生效，使用 1-based 索引和范围，例"
"如 `1,3,5-8`。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default; indices mode only. Uses 1-based indices and ranges "
"such as `1,3,5-8`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:80
#: 041d8c5cc7b04c6b8f22c261f4a60650
msgid "Z 轴范围（z_range）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:82
#: 826571bb5a184df6b8d120d67b42ad7c
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(0.0, 0.0)`。`center_mode=\"z_range\"` 时按笛卡"
"尔 z 坐标选择中心原子。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float,float]`, default `(0.0,0.0)`; z-range mode only. Selects "
"centers by Cartesian z."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:84
#: faf3392c70284c27b852357fb0ee1bc4
msgid "几何约束"
msgstr "Geometric constraints"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:86
#: 60d06b8473224310ae83e2f0ba4b411c
msgid "备用中心-质心壳层（shell）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:88
#: f8ac4e5304154ca6bd7dac237b77e1e9
msgid ""
"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(2.2, 4.5)`，单位 Å。普通放置时是局部中心到溶剂"
"质心的采样范围；`ion-water` 的第一配位壳不使用它，而是使用元素专属 ion–O 区"
"间。外半径必须大于内半径。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:90
#: 15ea67d25a964c778845fe7d96f94dab
msgid "统一最小距离覆盖值（min_distance）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:92
#: a2937111db674e47a1a5b8627616697a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0。大于 0 时，所有试放溶剂原子与已有原子之间都使用同一个最小距"
"离，且会忽略 `元素半径碰撞缩放`（`collision_scale`）；等于 0 时才使用元素碰撞"
"半径和 `元素半径碰撞缩放`（`collision_scale`）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:94
#: 6f122311052043b090d5847eb1ab2e4e
msgid "元素半径碰撞缩放（collision_scale）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:96
#: 1bc8a85ce890473aa8c54fe67cebe28a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用解析后放置模式的内置半径缩放；大于 0 时覆盖模式"
"默认值。仅在 `min_distance=0` 时生效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:98
#: 48e38e9ecc6843ef9b1f364e5e582060
msgid "最大尝试次数（max_attempts）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:100
#: 6a97cc0b3d0746338dcabea77b2458cf
msgid ""
"`int`，默认 3000。每个输出结构全部溶剂分子共享的总尝试次数，不是“每个分子 "
"3000 次”。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:102
#: 5bb25ff90fbf42399f48a3356d12fb26
msgid "严格数量（strict_count）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:104
#: e2fed334988f4b2093e4a4382eb0e207
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满 `每个输出的溶剂分子数`（`solvent_count`）就"
"失败；关闭后允许输出至少放入 1 个分子的部分结果。若一个分子都放不进去，即使关"
"闭严格数量也会报错，避免输出带标签但实际未溶剂化的原结构。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:106
#: 4bc3795c5c7d40a884bb295133f6889d
msgid "非周期输出"
msgstr "Nonperiodic output"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:108
#: 6be0abb26f9e4ba48854aee916e795ac
msgid "自动设置晶胞（auto_box）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:110
#: e631712dc2484ef49d08376e63863b5b
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 false。仅当输入没有有效 cell 时生效，打开后按输出坐标生成非周期"
"显示盒。输入已有有效 cell（包括周期晶胞）时，卡片始终保留原 cell 和 PBC，不会"
"因为这个选项把周期体系改成非周期体系。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:112
#: ebfed05d4463410d91aaf8dea2d99000
msgid "固定盒尺寸（box_size）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:114
#: 98905b008ef0441db42955294626358a
msgid ""
"`float`，默认 100.0，单位 Å。输入没有有效 cell 且 `auto_box=False` 时，输出会"
"居中放入这个固定的非周期显示盒。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:116
#: fbb3c24fbc2f42a4808e738a8c645803
msgid "晶胞留白（box_padding）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:118
#: fa2ccbb592f14d039325152ec53a5f67
msgid "`float`，默认 8.0，单位 Å。`auto_box=True` 时在坐标包围盒外增加的边距。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `8.0` Å. Margin around coordinates when `auto_box=True`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:120
#: e545c312ab2b4163bf0ea756ed4394b9
msgid "最小晶胞尺寸（min_box）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:122
#: f1ccb3a8e3884dd3991a6bf40d28ae41
msgid "`float`，默认 0.0，单位 Å。`auto_box=True` 时每条盒边的最小长度。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.0` Å. Minimum cell length when automatic boxing is "
"enabled."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:124
#: 4d37ff35bc4b4255b3880d9c542ff7c3
msgid "柔性溶剂"
msgstr "Flexible solvent molecules"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:126
#: ebcffd0392834d6bb56efdf46e0697bd
msgid "启用柔性溶剂（flex_solvent）"
