msgstr ""
"`int`, default `32`. Size of the conformer pool for a flexible solvent."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:134
#: 8a48215120f741cf9c0c9d002ac46843
