"`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时附"
"加的扭转角增量范围。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:138
