msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:140
#: c1d74f20a5db46af8f486101e611997b
msgid "`int`，默认 5。每个柔性构象最多扰动多少个可旋转键。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `5`. Maximum number of rotatable bonds perturbed in each "
"flexible conformer."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:142
