msgid "`float`，默认 0.03，单位 Å。柔性构象生成时叠加的坐标噪声。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0.03` Å. Coordinate noise added while generating flexible "
"conformers."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:146
