msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:203
#: d174bb2930624833abc4e4293acb4fab
msgid ""
"`Local Solvation → Geometry Filter`：先生成局部溶剂环境，再剔除短接触或异常体"
"积结构。"
msgstr ""
"`Local Solvation` -> `Geometry Filter`: reject short contacts or abnormal "
"cells after insertion."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:204
#: 5ff5a648a64142ba856d581f7765b1a9
msgid "`Local Solvation → FPS Filter`：局部溶剂化批量生成后抽代表结构送 DFT。"
msgstr ""
"`Local Solvation` -> `FPS Filter`: select representative solvated candidates "
"for DFT."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:206
#: 17252087a5884acbaefb13aa2acec7ed
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:208
#: dd57cdf6db43439fad31d9882f4cf514
msgid ""
"没有选到中心原子：检查 `溶剂化中心`（`center_mode`）是否和 `中心元素`"
"（`center_elements`）、`中心索引`（`center_indices`）或 `Z 轴范围`"
"（`z_range`）匹配。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:209
#: f653e00ac54342caa4983dff61b394f2
msgid ""
"一直插不满目标数量：降低 `每个输出的溶剂分子数`（`solvent_count`），放宽备用"
"壳层，减小统一最小距离或碰撞缩放；如果目标是周期整盒溶剂，优先改用 `Solvent "
"Box Fill`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:210
#: 8ef6c7b5aae64571aed54b46b850e9b4
msgid ""
"调了备用壳层但 Ca–O 距离没变化：`ion-water` 第一配位壳使用内置 ion–O 区间；卡"
"片预览会列出实际范围。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:211
#: df2edfd9bb0647c3947cb2802a3d7358
msgid ""
"输出有明显短接触：增大 `统一最小距离覆盖值`（`min_distance`）或 `元素半径碰撞"
"缩放`（`collision_scale`），再接 `Geometry Filter` 和 DFT/MD 预松弛。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:213
#: 1fd78a7aa8d240e9b59584c854edaefd
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:215
#: 922797f88eb74a1a979fbfa624ca6290
msgid "`SolvLocal(mode={mode},n={placed},sel={center_count})`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:217
#: e7afcf1a58a04e09ac9e51c98539a4dc
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/local-solvation-card.md:219
#: c0d8ffef562e4b2f874a334eb6cff692
msgid ""
"打开 `使用随机种子`（`use_seed`）后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 `随机种子"
"`（`seed`）会生成相同插入结果。若输入结构顺序、中心原子集合或溶剂分子文本发生"
"变化，输出也会随之变化。"
msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Local Solvation` 在选中原子周围插入一批溶剂分子，用来补充离子水合壳、局部"
#~ "极性环境、溶质附近初始溶剂排布等候选构型。它只生成几何初态，不做力场或 "
#~ "DFT 优化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Local Solvation` inserts solvent molecules around selected atoms to "
#~ "generate candidate ion hydration shells, local polar environments, or "
#~ "initial solvent arrangements near a solute. It creates geometry only and "
#~ "performs neither force-field nor DFT optimization."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "这张卡保留输入结构，并追加溶剂原子；输出会写入 `SolvLocal(...)` 标签，便于"
#~ "后续在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中筛选。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The input structure is retained and solvent atoms are appended. Output "
#~ "receives a `SolvLocal(...)` label for later filtering in `NEP Dataset "
#~ "Display`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "参数设置：`center_mode=\"elements\"`，`center_elements=\"Ca\"`，"
#~ "`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`，`solvent_count=6`，`shell=(2.6, 3.4)`，"
#~ "`min_distance=0.8`，打开 `use_seed`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Parameters: `center_mode=\"elements\"`, `center_elements=\"Ca\"`, "
#~ "`sampling_mode=\"auto\"`, `solvent_count=6`, `shell=(2.6,3.4)`, "
#~ "`min_distance=0.8`, and `use_seed` enabled."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 30。每个输出结构插入多少个溶剂分子。离子第一壳通常从 4-8 开"
#~ "始；大分子局部溶剂环境再按中心原子数量扩大。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `30`. Solvent molecules inserted per output. Start around "
#~ "4-8 for a first ion shell and scale deliberately for larger solutes or "
#~ "multiple centers."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `auto`。可选 `auto`、`general`、`water`、`ion-water`、"
#~ "`loose`、`dense`。`auto` 会在水分子和离子中心同时出现时使用 `ion-water`，"
#~ "只有水分子时使用 `water`，否则使用 `general`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `auto`. Options are `auto`, `general`, `water`, `ion-"
#~ "water`, `loose`, and `dense`. Auto selects `ion-water` for water around "
#~ "ionic centers, `water` for water otherwise, and `general` for other "
#~ "solvents."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `all`。可选 `all`、`elements`、`indices`、`z_range`。这决定哪"
#~ "些原子作为局部溶剂化中心。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `all`. One of `all`, `elements`, `indices`, or `z_range`; "
#~ "selects solvation centers."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(2.2, 4.5)`，单位 Å。局部溶剂中心到溶剂分子参"
#~ "考位置的采样壳层。外半径必须大于内半径。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float,float]`, default `(2.2,4.5)` Å. Radial shell for the solvent "
#~ "reference position around a center. Outer radius must exceed inner radius."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0。大于 0 时作为全局原子-原子最小距离；等于 0 时使用元素碰撞"
#~ "半径和 `collision_scale`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0`. A positive value is the global minimum atom-atom "
#~ "distance. At `0`, element-specific collision radii scaled by "
#~ "`collision_scale` are used."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 0。等于 0 时使用 `sampling_mode` 的内置半径缩放；大于 0 时覆"
#~ "盖模式默认值。它控制插入溶剂与已有原子之间的非键接触下限。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0`. Zero uses the sampling-mode collision scale; a "
#~ "positive value overrides it as a global minimum nonbonded contact "
#~ "distance."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`int`，默认 3000。每个输出结构的最大插入尝试次数。达到上限仍插不满时，"
#~ "`strict_count=True` 会报错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `3000`. Maximum placement attempts per output. If the "
#~ "target is not reached, `strict_count=True` raises an error."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 true。打开后，未插满 `solvent_count` 就失败；关闭后允许输出部"
#~ "分插入结果。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `true`. Fail unless all requested molecules are inserted; "
#~ "disabled permits partial output."

#~ msgid "`bool`，默认 false。打开后按输出坐标自动生成非周期盒子。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Build a nonperiodic cell around output "
#~ "coordinates."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`float`，默认 100.0，单位 Å。输入没有有效 cell 且 `auto_box=False` 时，输"
#~ "出会居中放入这个固定盒子；这对应原脚本的 `-box` 默认行为。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `100.0` Å. Fixed box used when the input lacks a valid "
#~ "cell and `auto_box=False`."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`bool`，默认 false。打开后复用仓库已有 torsion-guard core 生成溶剂构象池，"
#~ "再用于插入。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`bool`, default `false`. Use the existing torsion-guard core to build a "
#~ "solvent conformer pool before insertion."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`，默认 `(-180.0, 180.0)`，单位 degree。柔性构象生成时"
#~ "的扭转角范围。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`tuple[float, float]`, default `(-180.0, 180.0)` degrees. Torsion-angle "
#~ "range used to generate flexible conformers."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "没有选到中心原子：检查 `center_mode` 是否和 `center_elements`、"
#~ "`center_indices` 或 `z_range` 匹配。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "No centers selected: check that mode and its element, index, or z-range "
#~ "parameter match the input."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "一直插不满目标数量：降低 `solvent_count`，放宽 `shell`，减小 "
#~ "`min_distance` 或 `collision_scale`；如果目标是周期整盒溶剂，优先改用 "
#~ "`Solvent Box Fill`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cannot reach the target count: reduce count, widen the shell, or revise "
#~ "collision limits. For a full periodic solvent box, use `Solvent Box Fill` "
#~ "instead."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "输出有明显短接触：增大 `min_distance` 或 `collision_scale`，再接 "
#~ "`Geometry Filter` 和 DFT/MD 预松弛。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Obvious short contacts: increase collision separation, apply `Geometry "
#~ "Filter`, and pre-relax with DFT or MD."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "打开 `use_seed` 后，相同输入结构、结构顺序、参数和 `seed` 会生成相同插入结"
#~ "果。若输入结构顺序、中心原子集合或溶剂分子文本发生变化，输出也会随之变化。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "With `use_seed`, identical structures, order, parameters, centers, "
#~ "solvent text, and seed reproduce insertion. Changing any of those can "
#~ "change output."
